{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1000_p", "source_sha256": "675e045c5877142e094ff19ecb7e6a69b0e7da8c570b5d176b3b5c02492f0020", "ja": "（『SING MY SONG』のPV公開に合わせ、静香の\n単独ライブが行われた。とてもいい表情をしていたな）", "zh": "（配合《SING MY SONG》的PV公开，静香举办了单独演唱会。她当时的表情真是棒啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1001_null", "source_sha256": "78a63c367f3f40230fea8ec1e472a3ef268f0f5194922e230a77052da07f3bf5", "ja": "ワアアアアァァァ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "aa0cc57b45e70649ebb9c1170b62c50173b5278f40654a0ee7b7dd2dbb11cbc5", "ja": "すごい歓声……。\nライブが終わっても、まだ止まないなんて。", "zh": "好大的欢呼声……\n没想到演出结束了，欢呼声还没有停。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1003_p", "source_sha256": "23f351e49fc4464a1ae7d6b49caaf9988f18461fe597b9da646b9ff56204b941", "ja": "うん。ファンの人たちの、期待に応えられた証拠だな。\n掛け値なしで、いいステージだったと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯。这就是回应了粉丝们期待的证据吧。\n毫无疑问，这是一场非常棒的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "e9d44a14678e14fe81e791f3c49cbe3a05f99a03bd86f30577980a5c49911351", "ja": "これぐらい当然です。\n素敵な舞台を用意してもらいましたから……。", "zh": "这点程度是理所当然的。\n毕竟为我准备了这么棒的舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "9788b8a0f85316814a0109f7ffe5d2ff9c1e78adb7db2e9aa263e5d0cfad490c", "ja": "でも、ここはまだ通過点。ファンの人達には、\nもっと大きな舞台に立つ姿を見せたいですから。", "zh": "不过，这里还只是一个中途站。因为我想让粉丝们看到我站上更大的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1006_p", "source_sha256": "23ef8ef155c5b437b27eb7a5d7e3f4abcea664a5a0d72e8f96dfdab76451e11c", "ja": "はは、いつになく自信満々だな。\nでも、静香からその言葉が聞けてよかったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，你今天难得信心十足啊。不过，能听到静香说出这番话，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "c88473d7d46a9a7a6392edc1fb68a8defd35febff5a9a79e01849a50cae74dee", "ja": "べ、別に自信があるわけじゃありません。それくらい\n大きな気持ちを持った方がいいんじゃないかって……。", "zh": "才、才不是因为有自信呢。只是觉得，还是应该抱着那么大的决心才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1008_p", "source_sha256": "679c3e672828c0ee8f1d2a305929514efa768841402322e61395d0da8cd5da64", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\n……心配いらなかったな。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。\n……看来是我白担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "be3d442d7994aac4df07bde4b954860d1dd47a9f9bd89b151816ffc5c65ab53d", "ja": "えっ？　心配、ですか？", "zh": "咦？你说担心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4e5812df9a4f0a329ad3abf4ea31cb8ee843c22c77d5fc8ab074ac8a1065e902", "ja": "まあ、少しだけ……。今まで、\n色々なことを気にしてる姿を見てたからな。", "zh": "嗯，稍微有一点……毕竟之前\n一直看着你顾虑这顾虑那的样子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1011_p", "source_sha256": "df5a653111870a3cb8efa2ee8cc9cd9d3650579a8ee921358513dffdb0dc12af", "ja": "でも、今日のライブは純粋に楽しんでたし。\n大きな目標も聞けた……それが嬉しくてね。", "zh": "不过，今天的演唱会你是真心享受其中的。\n而且我还听到了你那远大的目标……我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "02cabeb7c3a6a85eeb657c3924e5e1b918ae0e4f9479ac88afaa06ed7653754c", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nそう、ですね。", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n是、这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "1e3c0dd966d5e43962fd5679fa71999be9d4e389c0f927af8538e28b109d7c9c", "ja": "正直……アイドルになって、目の前にいる人が\nプロデューサーだって知った時、不安になりました。", "zh": "说实话……成为偶像后，当我得知眼前的人就是制作人时，感到很不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "6c846f75c347beda8a3692664dced8c5cd25a8be53a21c21644b3e9eba8496b0", "ja": "実際、頼りないと思ったことも多くて。\nその度に、私も不安になったり、焦ったりして……。", "zh": "实际上，我也经常觉得您靠不住。\n每次都让我感到不安、焦躁……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4c9ead665b8ddbfcca42d8b8edcbf4c636549d84d5c15aaf6d3dbb18b0ab2943", "ja": "うっ……それについては本当に申し訳ない。", "zh": "呃……关于那件事，我真的非常抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "2f5b76ddc2af2d251955ed7d3a8b0e75edb4ee04ea54b940eb78415860b38692", "ja": "ふふっ……。\nそういう出来事も含めて、楽しかったんです。", "zh": "呵呵……\n包括那些事情在内，真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "39b8ef864afe52923cb8ed92524437f8460c20eed1d4b00a0923c7240bc75a46", "ja": "たくさんの温かい時間が、今の私を作ってくれた。\n私が今、ここに立っていられるのは……。", "zh": "许多温暖的时光，成就了现在的我。\n我如今还能站在这里，是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "abfe6960c15b49bf172f309378c8b0d54a2099539ca3827b2c1735028610526e", "ja": "{$P$}、貴方のおかげです。\nどんなに頼りなくても、きっと他の人じゃダメでした。", "zh": "{$P$}，都是因为有你。\n哪怕你再怎么不可靠，也一定非你不可。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1019_p", "source_sha256": "74bc3382d632fc1f821cdc65992906c332f18baf2720d5866f294455e85647af", "ja": "静香……。", "zh": "静香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "7ad030414d7a632b9f1bcbc195e0aba2caeaf44650e3283da18a2026c807f201", "ja": "私は、もっともっと先に行きます。さっきも\n言いましたけど、ここはまだ、通過点ですから。", "zh": "我会继续走得更远更远。刚才也说过了，这里还只是一个中途站。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "067e9f53af24968b449ac823156d16d540fb979bfe274f69cb0795a5b9c0732e", "ja": "自分の夢と、じっくり向き合いながら。いつか……\nこれが私の憧れたアイドルなんだって、伝わるように！", "zh": "一边认真面对自己的梦想。总有一天……要让大家明白，这就是我所憧憬的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0574_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "2ed0c5c93e851aad8c3959b302384245ea621c757c7012dbd6213140729df58d", "ja": "そのためにも、{$P$}……\nこれからもプロデュース、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "为此，{$P$}……\n今后也请继续负责我的制作工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
